# Local configuration — holds the NetBox token, the SNMP community and the
# FortiGate API key. Never commit.
#
# `.env.*` is deliberately broad: `*.env` alone would miss .env.prod,
# .env.local, .env.client-a and every other variant people actually create.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example

# Saved image tarballs (docker save … | gzip), which can be large and may embed
# a build-host CA.
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Site-specific credential profiles / seed, if you keep one outside .env
inventory.local.yml

# Corporate TLS-inspection CA. Specific to the machine the image is built on,
# and it identifies your organisation — regenerate it per build host, never
# commit it. See certs/README.md.
certs/*
!certs/README.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Agent / editor / OS state
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
